  "notes": [
    "Direct amendment over the immutable original consumed-test ledger; no earlier amendment, Stage-90 output, prediction surface, scratch directory, or checkpoint is a parent or input.",
    "The five whole-case folds rotate three disjoint roles. Fold f is evaluated, fold f+1 modulo five calibrates only the target-local directional flip rule, and the remaining three folds select among the eight frozen A1 source actions; evaluation labels cannot influence either operation. A nonpositive or unauthorized static source returns exactly B; B and U are controls, not static-source candidates.",
    "B, U, and all eight A1 action probabilities plus every label-free case-action feature are globally sealed before labels open. Same-target labels cannot update a shared model or select features, thresholds, hyperparameters, action strength, or geometry.",
    "Each fold decision is invariant to and sealed without its held evaluation labels; terminal scoring starts only after all 45 role-scoped decisions are sealed. F_S is the primary heuristic uncertainty-gated case-conditional diagnostic over S_static; its per-case score bound is descriptive and is not calibrated confidence or safety. O_static and O_case are terminal label-informed bounds only and cannot enter a pre-evaluation fit, decision, action, or seal.",
    "Exact pooled BACC and routing-identification metrics are terminal. This amendment cannot authorize routing success, action selection, promotion, deployment, a model or expert update, a numbered-stage feed, another Stage-90 experiment, or any other experiment."
